-- title:
--   Combined Gaussian preprocessing and query experiment
-- statement:
--   The final reduction combines the public Gaussian affine preprocessing with the single-query rank-one circuit. This interface specifies generic query layouts, randomized branches, the single-call relation, combined public coins, and the corresponding output probability experiment. The data support the exact Gaussian-to-zero-fiber advantage comparison.
